<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Simultaneous Orthogonal Matching Pursuit</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below, we provide the pseudocode for the Simultaneous Orthogonal Matching Pursuit (SOMP) algorithm <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Simultaneous Orthogonal Matching Pursuit (SOMP)</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input :</span> </span>Signal Matrix (head representation) <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{H}\in\mathbb{R}^{n,d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐇</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{H}\in\mathbb{R}^{n,d}</annotation></semantics></math>, dictionary <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{D}\in\mathbb{R}^{v,d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐃</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{D}\in\mathbb{R}^{v,d}</annotation></semantics></math>, number of iterations <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output :</span> Reconstruction <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{H}_{r}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐇</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>N</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{H}_{r}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>, support set <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{S}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝕊</mi><mi>N</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{S}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Initialization:</span> Residual <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{R}^{0}=\mathbf{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐑</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐇</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{R}^{0}=\mathbf{H}</annotation></semantics></math>, reconstruction <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{H}_{r}^{0}=\mathbf{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐇</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{H}_{r}^{0}=\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, support set <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{S}^{0}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝕊</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{S}^{0}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.4.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{0,...,N-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{0,...,N-1\}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}\leftarrow\mathbf{D}{\mathbf{R}^{t}}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐏</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>𝐃𝐑</mi><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></mmultiscripts></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}\leftarrow\mathbf{D}{\mathbf{R}^{t}}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{t}\leftarrow\arg\max_{j=1}^{k}(||\mathbf{P}[j]||_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐏</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{t}\leftarrow\arg\max_{j=1}^{k}(||\mathbf{P}[j]||_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{S}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbb{S}^{t}\cup\{p^{t}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝕊</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝕊</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{S}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbb{S}^{t}\cup\{p^{t}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}^{t}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\mathbf{W}}||\mathbf{H}-\mathbf{W}{\mathbf{D}[\mathbb{S}^{t}]}||_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><mi>𝐖</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐇</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐖𝐃</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>𝕊</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}^{t}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\mathbf{W}}||\mathbf{H}-\mathbf{W}{\mathbf{D}[\mathbb{S}^{t}]}||_{F}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{H}_{r}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}^{t}{\mathbf{D}[\mathbb{S}^{t}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐇</mi><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐃</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>𝕊</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{H}_{r}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}^{t}{\mathbf{D}[\mathbb{S}^{t}]}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{R}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{H}-\mathbf{H}_{r}^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>𝐇</mi><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐇</mi><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{R}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{H}-\mathbf{H}_{r}^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline">end for
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We summarize in <a href="#A2.T4" title="In Appendix B Prompts ‣ Head Pursuit: Probing Attention Specialization inMultimodal Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> the exact text templates used to construct the prompts for each evaluated task. These templates define the structure of model inputs across all datasets and settings considered in our experiments.</p>
</div>
