<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Model details</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All models we employ are taken pre-trained from the HuggingFace <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">transformers</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib52" title="" class="ltx_ref">52</a>]</cite> library. We report in <a href="#A3.T5" title="In Appendix C Model details ‣ Head Pursuit: Probing Attention Specialization inMultimodal Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> the full list of pre-trained models we employed in this work, associated with the name of the corresponding checkpoint in the library.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure ltx_flex_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A3.T5.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"></p></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Reference guide for pre-trained model checkpoints in HuggingFace <span id="A3.T5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">transformers</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib52" title="" class="ltx_ref">52</a>]</cite> library.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="A3.T5.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A3.T5.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T5.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Name in the paper</th>
<th id="A3.T5.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Pre-trained checkpoint name</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T5.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Mistral(-7B)</td>
